{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/56290-when-is-a-werewolf-forsaken","id":56290,"title":"When is a Werewolf Forsaken?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Werewolf: The Forsaken"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-01-23T12:36:06-08:00","id":56290,"title":"When is a Werewolf Forsaken?","content":"At what point do you consider a werewolf to be one of the Forsaken? <br /> <br /> Is it at First Change? That first dot of Renown? Or when the Oath is sworn and the cub is inducted into one of the Tribes?<br /> <br /> For that matter, when is the Oath given?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/370-oriares","name":"Oriares","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar370_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"404"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-23T13:31:56-08:00","id":56330,"title":"","content":"When the decision to run with the Forsaken Tribes instead of the Pure Tribes is made.<br /> <br /> As far as when the Oath is taken (not given), that's up to the individual, but it's usually after the Rite of Initiation. They could choose to take it sooner, which would lack the formality of taking it with the Rite, but would be more personal.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>- If you must be ridiculous, I must ridicule you.<br /> - Those that can give up essential liberties in exchange for temporary safety deserve neither liberty nor safety. -- Benjamin Franklin</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/375-papa-bear","name":"Papa Bear","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar375_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1920"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-23T23:08:54-08:00","id":56597,"title":"","content":"It's a name, it's not a spiritual condition.<br /> <br /> The Pure consider you Forsaken if you're not Pure.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/286-christian-a","name":"Christian A","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"832"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-24T07:21:33-08:00","id":56731,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Christian A</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/56290-when-is-a-werewolf-forsaken?p=56597#post56597\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">It's a name, it's not a spiritual condition.<br /> <br /> The Pure consider you Forsaken if you're not Pure.</div> </div> </div> </div>Well, since it's Werewolf, it's about as much a spiritual condition as it is a choice. I mean, if someone goes to the Pure side from the Forsaken side, they have to peel some pieces off of the poor schmuck to convert him.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>- If you must be ridiculous, I must ridicule you.<br /> - Those that can give up essential liberties in exchange for temporary safety deserve neither liberty nor safety. -- Benjamin Franklin</i>","edite